        <h3>Reminders that refill cancelled slots</h3>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Challenge</dt><dd>Missed appointments leave chairs empty, and staff spend mornings calling patients to confirm.</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Automation solution</dt><dd>Patients confirm or reschedule in one tap, and any freed slot is offered to waitlist patients automatically.</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <details class="case">
          <summary>View case study <span class="arr" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></summary>
          <ol>
            <li><span><b>Remind.</b> SMS or WhatsApp goes out 48 and 24 hours before each appointment.</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Respond.</b> The patient confirms, reschedules or cancels with one tap.</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Refill.</b> A cancelled slot is offered to waitlist patients in order until someone takes it.</span></li>
            <li><span><b>Report.</b> Reception gets a morning summary of confirmations and remaining gaps.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </details>
      </article>

